  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A grayscale stencil airbrush painting of a city street with a cyclist in the foreground, in soft grey blobs on white paper.",
    "description": "A square stencil airbrush painting on white paper, in black and grey only. The street scene is broken into rounded cells with white gaps: receding buildings with window rows at upper left and right, a wheel with a star shaped hub at lower left, a cyclist from behind at lower centre, pedestrians and a crosswalk in the middle. Each cell is shaded with a soft gradient from dark to pale. The sky is bare paper.",
    "impression": "The base state of the Bike series, with the stencil doing all the work and no colour to distract. It looks like a halftone photograph melted slightly. The grey makes the city feel like morning before the signs come on.",
